    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A light, nimble frame built for stealth and speed.</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Small or Medium</p><p><strong>Speeds</strong> land 40 feet, climb 20 feet</p><p><strong>Attacks</strong> Melee <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> blade (agile, finesse, versatile P), Damage 1d6 slashing</p><p><strong>Attribute Modifiers</strong> Str +1, Dex +3, Con +2, Int -4, Wis +2, Cha -1</p><p><strong>Ancestry Hit Points</strong> 6</p><p><strong>Trained Skill</strong> Stealth</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> Low-light vision (plus the construct base senses: precise vision, imprecise hearing, vague touch)</p><hr /><p><strong>Support Benefit: Aerial Retrieval</strong> An item or weapon the robot companion is carrying is launched up to 20 feet into the air. You Interact to catch the item.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver: Surgical Strike</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (Traversal) The robot companion Strides and then makes a blade Strike. If it hits, and the robot companion was undetected, the target takes an additional 1d6 precision damage (2d6 if your robot companion is burly or deft). If it was undetected at the start of its Surgical Strike, it remains undetected until after the Strike. (Requires Advanced Drone feat)</p>"
